<!-- ─── SECTION 1: WHAT WE DELIVER ─── -->
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="kicker">Business Intelligence</span>
    <h2>See what is happening. Understand why. Act faster.</h2>
    <p>BTS connects your data sources and transforms operational information into dashboards, reports and useful insight.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="svc"><h3>Executive Dashboards</h3><p>Clear dashboards for KPIs, performance, operations and management reporting.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Data Integration</h3><p>Bring data together from spreadsheets, databases, business systems and APIs.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Operational Analytics</h3><p>Identify trends, bottlenecks, exceptions and opportunities across your operations.</p></div>
    <div class="svc"><h3>Predictive Insight</h3><p>Use historical and operational data to identify patterns and support forward-looking decisions.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

